==Strategy==
[[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train]] the Gabriels at the start and immediately gun it towards the enemy base. You'll want to stall Sathankhamun VIII with [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone Cats]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cats]] until St. Dober spawns; the more time it takes for Sathankhamun VIII to reach the Cat Base, the better. Lure everybody, let the Cat Base tank until St. Dober gets close enough, then summon [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Master of Logic Newtone]] and [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Master of Mind Soractes]]. Ideally, you want to do this without any meatshields, since they will trigger constant Surge Attacks that prevent you from getting anything else done. Soractes should hopefully keep St. Dober in a stunlock, but wait until Mini Angel Cyclone spawns to deploy [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. If you don't trust Fraudactes to permafreeze St. Dober, feel free to include [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] or [[Eggy Cat (Rare Cat)|Eggy Cat]] to help out, otherwise break out your Mythic Cats' Conjures and/or [[Ototo Corps#Thunderbolt|Thunderbolt Cannon]] if things start looking rather precarious. With the help of a few [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cats]], [[Food Stall Cat (Rare Cat)|Cafeteria Cats]], and maybe [[Ancient Egg: N106 (Rare Cat)|Mushroom Cats]], you should eat through all of St. Dober's HP before Sathankhamun VIII can reach the frontlines, assuming you stalled well enough. Obviously, the nature of St. Dober's Surge Attacks can make any strategy feel inconsistent, so just adjust your playstyle accordingly.

Job's not finished, though, and the second Mini Angel Cyclone will pose problems if you're unprepared. Try to knock back Sathankhamun VIII before she spawns, since you'll need a good amount of space to deny her from escorting you to heaven directly. Luckily, Awakened Bahamut Cat will almost be off cooldown by that point, so it isn't too difficult to hold her back until eventually nuking her out of existence with a few clean hits. Nothing dangerous spawns anymore, so cleanup is relatively easy.

